{
	"_units": "Wave 5 V1 (Vehicle, VehicleSpecs). Everything here is Proposed unless the note names Captain. Positions are metres in the vehicle's own frame: x right, y up from the ground under the wheels, z back (-z is the front), the origin the middle of the footprint (VehicleArt's frame). Boxes are [x0, y0, z0, x1, y1, z1]. kind: wheeled, tracked or helicopter (helicopters park and carry; V3 flies them). class: the vehicle's armour family (for the HUD and AI). Speeds in km/h, accel and brake in m/s2, fuel in litres. wheels: [x, z, radius, steers] (tracked: road wheels, both sides). boxes: collision (hull, cabin, turret): bullets meet the boxes, then VehicleHull finds the 5 cm voxel they actually hit. zones: hit zones (Vehicle.ZONE_*) by box, first match wins, with an armour class (armour below) and hp_kj, the kilojoules of penetrating damage that wreck the zone; the hull (hp.hull) takes HULL_SHARE of every penetrating hit and the vehicle is destroyed (burns, then a wreck) at 0. seats: at = the eye (the camera), stance sit (crouched pose) or stand (gunner in a hatch or a pickup bed), exit side, open = seen from outside (else hidden inside). shown = inside but in sight (an open cabin). A sitting rider is drawn seated (Captain 2026-10-14): hips on the cushion under the eye, feet on the cabin floor (VehicleInteriors.FLOORS), facing face = degrees left of the front (default 0, Proposed). UH-60 cabin seats are 0.58 m apart (Proposed): the drawn soldier is 0.52 m across the shoulders. gun: the gunner seat's mounted weapon (guns below) and its muzzle (at, at rest). turret: the gun's mount turns (VehicleTurret, Captain 2026-10-13): pivot = the ring's axis (x, z) and its top (y), radius and top = the voxels that turn with it, gun = the voxels that elevate (box, colours) about the trunnion [y, z], traverse_deg (missing: all round) and elevation_deg limits, traverse_dps and elevation_dps speeds. points: Left Ctrl action points (door: the seats it serves; cargo; service: repairs, refuel, salvage).",
